# Strictness proof: $begin forces each subexpression eagerly in order.
# Unlike dict entries (which are lazy thunks), $begin evaluates each expression
# for its effect and discards all but the last. This is the deliberate strictness
# escape hatch for sequencing side effects.
# Here both additions are evaluated; only the last result is returned.
[result: [begin [+ 1 2] [+ 3 4]]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Int(7)})
